Subject: [PATCH V3 1/4] clk: bulk: add of_clk_bulk_get()
In-Reply-To: <1527244643-10736-1-git-send-email-aisheng.dong@nxp.com>
References: <1527244643-10736-1-git-send-email-aisheng.dong@nxp.com>
